item.description:
BO - Modules - Updates tab - Uninstall Details Component : Core Status : To be automated Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-7641 Specification : https://docs.prestashop-project.org/functional-documentation/functional-documentation/ux-ui/back-office/modules Steps Step Description Expected result BO &gt; Modules &gt; Module Manager &gt; Updates tab &gt; Click on Upgrade button A modal appears
!https://forge.prestashop.com/plugins/servlet/raven/tempattachment/5198812946632889985/Module-notifications-%E2%80%A2-Presta811.png! On the modal click on Upgrade anyway button * This message is displayed : &ldquo;Upgrade action on module blockwishlist succeeded.&quot;
* The button in front of module is named &ldquo;Configure&rdquo; Click on the arrow next to Configure button &gt; Click on Uninstall

Wishlist module - Create a list Details Component : blockwishlist Status : To be automated Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-8100 Steps Step Description Expected result Go to FO &gt; Choose a product &gt; Click on the heart next to the image to add the product to a list A &ldquo;Sign in&rdquo; modal is opened with:
* Title: &ldquo;Sign in&rdquo;
* Description: &ldquo;You need to be logged in to save products in your wishlist.

Autoupgrade - Web Version - Verification during backup part Details Component : Core Status : IN REVIEW Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-5641 Specification : https://forge.prestashop.com/browse/SUE-8 Steps Step Description Expected result Go to &ldquo;Update Assistant&rdquo; module (side board). &ldquo;Update Assistant&rdquo; module is displayed : * Title : &ldquo;Welcome to PrestaShop Update Assistant&rdquo;
* Two radio buttons : &ldquo;Update your store&rdquo; and &ldquo;Restore from a backup&rdquo; (disabled)
* CTA &ldquo;Get started&rdquo; disabled Select the radio button &ldquo;Update your store&rdquo;.

