BO - Design - Image Settings : Check product image format Details Component : Core Status : Automated Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-8257 Test : https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/tree/develop/tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/08_design/06_imageSettings/13_checkProductImageFormat.ts Specification : https://docs.prestashop-project.org/functional-documentation/functional-documentation/ux-ui/back-office/improve/design/image-settings/add-new-image-type Steps Step Description Expected result * Go to BO &gt; Design &gt; Image settings
* Scroll down to have image generation option * JPEG/PNG should be checked * You can&rsquo;t unchecked the JPEG/PNG format
* Base format should be : &ldquo;Use PNG only if the base image is in PNG format&rdquo; Check the checkboxes next to Webp The checkbox should be checked and the Webp is enabled * Go to Catalog &gt; Product * Click on &ldquo;Add new product&rdquo;

FO - Product page - Product page : Change combination Details Component : Core Status : Automated Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-7941 Test : https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/tree/develop/tests/UI/campaigns/functional/FO/classic/09_productPage/02_productPage/08_changeCombination.ts Steps Step Description Expected result Go to BO &gt; Attrabutes and Features The tab Attributes should be displayed * Clic on &ldquo;Add a new Attribute&rdquo;
* Set up your Attributes * Clic on Save * The Attributes page should be displayed
* The field with the &ldquo;*&rdquo; should be setted

Autoupgrade - Web Version - Configuration settings for backup part to On Details Component : Core Status : À faire Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-5651 Steps Step Description Expected result Go to &ldquo;Update Assistant&rdquo; module (side board). * &ldquo;Update Assistant&rdquo; module is displayed : ** Title : &ldquo;Welcome to PrestaShop Update Assistant&rdquo;
** Two radio buttons : &ldquo;Update your store&rdquo; and &ldquo;Restore from a backup&rdquo; (disabled)
** CTA &ldquo;Get started&rdquo; disabled Select the radio button &ldquo;Update your store&rdquo;.

