BO - Design - Image Settings - Delete actions Details Component : Core Status : Automated Automated on : 8.1.x, 9.0.x, 9.1.x, 9.2.x, 9.3.x Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-8202 Test : https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/tree/develop/tests/UI/campaigns/functional/BO/08_design/06_imageSettings/06_deleteActions.ts Specification : https://docs.prestashop-project.org/functional-documentation/functional-documentation/ux-ui/back-office/improve/design/image-settings/add-new-image-type Steps Step Description Expected result * Do the Precondition &ldquo;BO - Image Settings - Create an Image type random&rdquo; twice
* Scroll down and click on &ldquo;Regenerate thumbnails&rdquo;
* Clic on &ldquo;Regenerate&rdquo; on the modal * You&rsquo;ll have two new image type

